   "design": "Manuals and drawings are indexed by equipment tag, so search finds them, instead of browsing the archive. Questions are answered from the plant's own manuals with the page quoted, or not at all, and the technician opens the cited page before acting. The index runs on premises or with an assessed supplier. Applying instructions, asking colleagues, equipment data, vendor mail and notes stay with the technician.",
